    {
      "type": "grid",
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "heading": "Atualizações",
          "heading_style": "title",
          "icon": "mdi:update",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 12,
            "rows": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "title": "Docker - Status dos Containers",
          "content": "{% set updates = states.update | selectattr('entity_id', 'match', '^update\\.(wud_container_local_|sistema_docker_)') | list %}\n{% set total = updates | count %}\n{% set pendentes = updates | selectattr('state', 'eq', 'on') | list | count %}\n{% set desconhecidos = updates | selectattr('state', 'eq', 'unknown') | list | count %}\n{% set atualizados = total - pendentes - desconhecidos %}\n**Atualizados:** {{ atualizados }}  \n**Para atualizar:** {{ pendentes }}  \n**Desconhecidos:** {{ desconhecidos }}",
          "tap_action": {
            "action": "navigate",
            "navigation_path": "/dashboard-casa/docker-atualizacoes"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "heading": "Backups Duplicati",
          "heading_style": "title",
          "icon": "mdi:backup-restore"
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "SSD = **docker-local** (diário, alerta após 36h). OneDrive = **homelab-onedrive** (semanal, alerta após 9 dias)."
        },
        {
          "type": "entities",
          "title": "Resumo",
          "show_header_toggle": false,
          "state_color": true,
          "entities": [
            {
              "entity": "sensor.sistema_docker_backup_ssd_linha",
              "name": "Backup SSD",
              "icon": "mdi:harddisk"
            },
            {
              "entity": "sensor.sistema_docker_backup_onedrive_linha",
              "name": "Backup OneDrive",
              "icon": "mdi:microsoft-onedrive"
            },
            {
              "entity": "sensor.sistema_docker_backup_problemas",
              "name": "Problemas",
              "icon": "mdi:alert-circle"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "square": false,
          "type": "grid",
          "columns": 2,
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "input_select.sistema_docker_backup_ssd_estado",
              "name": "Estado SSD",
              "icon": "mdi:harddisk"
            },
            {
              "type": "tile",
              "entity": "input_datetime.sistema_docker_backup_ssd_ultimo",
              "name": "Último SSD",
              "icon": "mdi:clock-outline"
